    "response": "{\"verdict\":\"PASS\",\"p0_p1_defects\":[],\"verified_items\":[\"R1: Windows _execute_bounded_process delivers stdin_bytes via a private temp file and supervised Python wrapper without writing to or closing the windows_job_supervisor.py cancellation stdin pipe until cancel/timeout/overflow.\",\"R2: Promptfoo provider writes run evidence to a durable per-run directory under evidenceRootDir (.forgewright/runtime/promptfoo-evidence/<task>-<uuid>) and only cleans up the temporary spec staging directory.\",\"R3: Pi provider capability probe and resolveProvider report google-api as unsupported (pinned_pi_ai_adapter_rejects_guarded_custom_fetch) and fail closed without bypassing guardedFetch.\",\"R4: scripts/ci/verify-platform.py --matrix-summary executes real capability test suites, binds all 22 KEY_REVISION_FILES into revision_binding (head_sha and source_digest), and fails closed when any required toolchain binary is unavailable or any capability check fails.\",\"R5: scripts/runtime/openspec_contract_adapter.py binds each task to contract_revision and requirement_digest and invalidates verified task state across revisions whenever requirement or acceptance criteria change, while preserving evidence_paths and artifact_digests in reviewer packets.\",\"R6: scripts/runtime/skill_routing.py routes positive motion-director prompts in no-mode auto-detect execution and excludes backend/API/database/version tasks that merely mention GSAP or other motion library names.\",\"R7: evals/promptfoo/forgewright-runner-provider.ts computes outer spawnSync timeout as agentTimeout + verifierTimeout + 15s and emits a structured terminal fallback receipt when a child fails to write receipt.json.\",\"R8: scripts/runtime/runtime-hooks-install.sh separates documented_events from canary-backed observed_events, and scripts/bootstrap/forgewright-install.sh plus scripts/hooks/forgewright-hook-doctor.sh distribute and verify antigravity-stop-hook.sh for clean consumers.\",\"R9: src/cli/src/docs/markdown.ts and src/cli/src/docs/render.ts canonicalize raw/URI-decoded/NFC link targets in the catalog map, pass catalog resolution trust to safeUrl in both markdown-it and legacy engines, and strip unresolved parent traversal links.\",\"R10: scripts/runtime/skill_eval_receipt.py sets cleanup_complete=False whenever WindowsJobClient.validate raises CompletionError and aggregates agent and verifier cleanup completion conservatively.\",\"V2-01: scripts/ci/verify-platform.py ignores same-host merged receipts (same_host_merge_ignored=True), enforces distinct passing capability coverage on foreign-host merged receipts, and propagates invalid_merged_receipt / REVISION_MISMATCH to top-level status=FAIL and exit code 1.\",\"V2-02: scripts/runtime/openspec_contract_adapter.py uses a single strict task verification predicate requiring status=='verified' plus matching contract_revision and requirement_digest across projection, completion check, and revision reconciliation.\",\"V2-03: scripts/runtime/runtime-hooks-install.sh wires and verifies both PreToolUse and Stop hooks for Antigravity in standalone mode without clobbering existing custom hooks.\",\"V2-04: src/cli/src/docs/markdown.ts blocks raw, percent-encoded, double-encoded, and mixed-separator parent traversal in both links and images across markdown-it and legacy engines, with src/cli/dist/index.js rebuilt and matching the manifest digest.\",\"V2-05: scripts/runtime/verify_motion_drawer_artifact.mjs verifies Escape close without mouse fallback, mid-transition interruption at 35ms while animations are active, and mobile touch open/close under prefers-reduced-motion in real headless Chromium; all 43 durable artifact digests in rf01-baseline-runs.jsonl resolve on disk.\"],\"verified_remediations\":[\"R1\",\"R2\",\"R3\",\"R4\",\"R5\",\"R6\",\"R7\",\"R8\",\"R9\",\"R10\",\"V2-01\",\"V2-02\",\"V2-03\",\"V2-04\",\"V2-05\"],\"manifest_sha256_checked\":\"0c5f76b0d4f88b037495890fa6f98f0fa729dd691452713350b8d6dbd6c4